abstract: "Retained source, configurations, original-PyTorch diagnostic entry, saved evidence mappings and companion data for the 2026 DOP-Net manuscript. Bounded runtime checks and unresolved cross-platform numerical limitations are documented in the repository README and VALIDATION.md."
keywords:
  - channel estimation
  - MIMO-OFDM
  - Doppler
  - reproducibility
